ut she catches the rat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_07_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_07_20","text":"The sudden exertion aggravates her cough, and her vision blurs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_07_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_07_21","text":"She lightly wipes the rat to clean it before slipping it into her bag.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_07_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_07_22","text":"Her afternoon shift begins.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_07_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_07_23","text":"She opens the fourth door. A liquor bottle flies through the air, smashing against her head and breaking apart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ArkCleanIndoor","bgArt":"arkcleanindoor","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_07_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_07_24","text":"Dizziness washes over her as the sound of running footsteps approaches.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_07_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_07_25","text":"A brief commotion breaks out, then dies down. She wraps her bleeding head with a filthy cloth and resumes cleaning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt